#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_StevensHouse/scripts.inc:194
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_StevensHouse_Text_LetterFromSteven"
msgid ""
"It's a letter.\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"To {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"I've decided to do a little soul-\n"
"searching and train on the road.\p"
"I don't plan to return home for some\n"
"time.\p"
"I have a favor to ask of you.\p"
"I want you to take the POKé BALL on\n"
"the desk.\p"
"Inside it is a BELDUM, my favorite\n"
"POKéMON.\p"
"I'm counting on you.\p"
"May our paths cross someday.\p"
"STEVEN STONE$"
msgstr ""

